<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Evangeline" data-copy-zh="Evangeline">Evangeline</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Corporate progression, three heart-to-hearts and the current conditions for Mystic Seduction." data-copy-zh="企业路线、三次谈心与神秘诱惑的当前条件。">Corporate progression, three heart-to-hearts and the current conditions for Mystic Seduction.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Evangeline</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Current_Content_Status"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Off_the_Record"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Unpriced"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Not_a_Plus-One"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Heart_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Early_Evangeline_Affection"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Maggie_and_Actual_Company_Ownership"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Evangeline — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/evangeline.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Evangeline — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/evangeline.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Evangeline — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Evangeline’s access is tied to Miki’s corporate progression and actual company ownership. Her early dismissive portrait is not a missing Talk button that ordinary gift grinding can bypass.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find Evangeline</h2><p>Use Present → Downtown → Offices → Boardroom,09:00–15:00 daily. Later corporate events also use the downtown restaurant and mansion; follow their separate evening windows.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Boardroom</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Mystic_Seduction_After_the_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Evangeline.27s_Personal_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Evangeline's_Personal_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Opening_the_Corporate_Route"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Progress Miki’s investment-related objectives. Some earlier boardroom events need 25 and 40 owned companies; Requested by Name needs all 50 companies owned. A company with fully purchased shares is not yet owned until its buyout is complete.</p><p>After Requested by Name, visit the boardroom for The Price of Attention, then complete the first heart-to-heart. Continue through Family Business at the mansion dining room 20:00–23:00, Due Diligence at the boardroom 09:00–15:00, and Private Valuation at the restaurant 20:00–22:00.</p><p>The later mansion-foyer objective starts 20:00–23:00 and also checks Miki’s Terms of Ownership, What Are You Building? and No Audience; Arnold’s Household Risk; and Service With a Sneer plus The Food Court Gauntlet. The optional Off the Record conversation follows Unpriced at Crush(400),13:00–15:00. This page lists progression conditions without describing the corporate conclusion.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Not a Plus-One</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Boardroom; 09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); after The Price of Attention; corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Unpriced</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Boardroom; 09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); after Private Valuation / Not a Plus-One; corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Off the Record</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Boardroom; 13:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after Private Valuation / Unpriced; corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −25 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Actions_and_Optional_Off_the_Record"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Talk requires Acknowledged(10), takes 15 minutes and allows 2 safe uses per day. Ruthless Excellence is a one-time Commerce+1 reward at Acknowledged with Communication 90 and 30 minutes.</p><p>Use Mystic Seduction is a late, mutually agreed interaction after the corporate mansion-foyer objective is complete. It needs the learned Mystic Seduction skill,Mystic 90,30 minutes,50 Energy and the corresponding content access, once per day. Learning the skill alone does not make this action available early.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Use Mystic Seduction</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Boardroom; 09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0); Mystic 90; learn Mystic Seduction; after Controlling Interest; corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min; −50 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Evangeline</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Boardroom; 09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">2 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ruthless Excellence</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Boardroom; 09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acknowledged (10); Communication 90</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">Commerce +1; base relationship +15; once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>If you are still Stranger, advance the corporate events instead of looking for a gift or Talk shortcut. If an ownership threshold fails, distinguish level 5 investment from company buyout.</p><p>If a later event stalls, check the named conversations for Miki and Arnold as well as Evangeline’s own. Visit the restaurant or mansion at the event’s evening time; the boardroom schedule does not cover those scenes.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-investment-system.html">Company investment and buyouts</a> · <a href="character-miki.html">Miki</a> · <a href="character-arnold.html">Arnold</a> · <a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Current_Content_Status"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Off_the_Record"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Unpriced"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Not_a_Plus-One"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Heart_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Early_Evangeline_Affection"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Maggie_and_Actual_Company_Ownership"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Evangeline 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/evangeline.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Evangeline 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/evangeline.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Evangeline 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Evangeline的互动权限与Miki的企业路线、实际公司所有权相连。初期只有疏离的头像回应，并不表示少了一个能靠普通赠礼绕过的交谈按钮。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>路线为现代 → 市中心 → 办公楼 → 董事会议室，每天09:00—15:00。后续企业事件还会去市中心餐厅与豪宅，应按各自的晚间时段到访。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">董事会议室</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Mystic_Seduction_After_the_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Evangeline.27s_Personal_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Evangeline's_Personal_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Opening_the_Corporate_Route"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先推进Miki与投资有关的目标。较早的会议室事件分别检查已拥有25家公司、40家公司；「点名邀请」要求全部50家公司都已收购。股份投满5级并不等于拥有公司，还需完成买断。</p><p>完成「点名邀请」后，去会议室推进「关注的代价」，再完成首次谈心。之后依次到豪宅餐厅20:00—23:00推进「家族生意」，会议室09:00—15:00推进「尽职调查」，市中心餐厅20:00—22:00推进「私下估值」。</p><p>后续豪宅门厅目标在20:00—23:00开始，还会检查Miki的「所有权条款」「你在建造什么？」「谢绝观众」，Arnold的「家庭风险」，以及「冷笑相迎的服务」和「美食广场考验」。可选的「不作记录」在完成第二次谈心后、迷恋（400）时于13:00—15:00开放。本页只说明推进条件，不展开企业路线的结论。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">不再是陪衬</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">董事会议室; 09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）；完成：关注的代价；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">75分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未标价</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">董事会议室; 09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；完成：私下估值、不再是陪衬；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不作记录</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">董事会议室; 13:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：私下估值、未标价；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90分钟；−25 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Actions_and_Optional_Off_the_Record"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>交谈要求已遇见（10），耗15分钟，每天安全额度2次。已遇见且沟通90时，可花30分钟进行一次「冷酷卓越」，永久增加商业1。</p><p>使用神秘诱惑是企业豪宅门厅目标完成后的自愿互动，需要已学会该技能、神秘90、30分钟、精力50与相应内容权限，每天一次。只学会技能并不会让动作在前期开放。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">使用神秘诱惑</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">董事会议室; 09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）；神秘90；学会神秘诱惑；完成：控股权；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟；−50 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与Evangeline交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">董事会议室; 09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">2次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">冷酷卓越</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">董事会议室; 09:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">已遇见（10）；沟通90</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">商业 +1；基础关系+15；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>还在陌生人阶段时，推进企业事件，而不是找赠礼或交谈捷径。公司数量不满足时，分清5级投资与已完成收购。</p><p>后续事件停住时，除了Evangeline，也要检查Miki和Arnold的指定谈心。餐厅与豪宅事件须在其晚间时段到访，不能套用白天会议室时间。</p></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><p><a href="game-systems-investment-system.html">公司投资与收购</a> · <a href="character-miki.html">Miki</a> · <a href="character-arnold.html">Arnold</a> · <a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系系统</a></p></section>
